Subject: Cantor Attention Manifest Refresh P6

@ [specification_uuid] 9538a5f2-779b-4862-9084-d531270f9649
@ [upstream_assessment_uuid] d48bb7b6-c894-4237-9387-472075c596bf

& [Purpose]
  + make the complete identity basket continuously visible to inference at compact cost while materializing exact object bodies separately and producing a current full-coverage attention receipt

& [Requirements]
  + [AMR-01] define a compact manifest entry containing exact handle object_type one deterministic display label version and record_digest without copying mutable object body collections
  + [AMR-02] derive one deterministic complete manifest from every current ledger with every handle exactly once in canonical order and content-bound count ledger digest and manifest digest
  + [AMR-03] refuse when even the complete compact manifest exceeds its declared byte budget and never silently omit or truncate a member
  + [AMR-04] give the inference window the complete rendered manifest while retaining exact frame purpose frame digest and current ledger binding
  + [AMR-05] add a read-only materialize operation taking a bounded exact handle set and returning complete current object records plus an explicit account of every requested handle
  + [AMR-06] refuse duplicate over-bound malformed stale or unknown materialization requests rather than guessing labels or returning partial unaccounted data
  + [AMR-07] add a read-only acknowledge_attention operation carrying a receipt seed bound to the exact current window ledger manifest and materialized handle set
  + [AMR-08] require exactly one Relevant NotApplicable or Unresolved disposition with nonempty rationale for every manifest member and no foreign member
  + [AMR-09] require every Relevant member to have been materialized and retain every supplied evidence reference without classifying it as verified
  + [AMR-10] derive Held whenever any member is Unresolved and Complete only when the full manifest has no unresolved member
  + [AMR-11] make any ledger generation change stale every prior window materialization and receipt so inference must refresh before reuse
  + [AMR-12] expose project materialize and acknowledge through the existing typed MCP while appending no journal event producing no successor and changing no durable head
  + [AMR-13] preserve exact handle resolution inspection historical reads patch admission replay persistence and all predecessor fixtures
  + [AMR-14] test same-type individuation complete membership capacity refusal selection accounting stale refresh held status deterministic replay and zero mutation then run strict lint workspace verification and detached clean replay
  + [AMR-15] claim no internal model attention pointer consciousness external truth background closure effect authority authentication or publication

& [Delineation]
  + [inside] is compact complete manifest exact materialization full-coverage receipt refresh staleness typed read-only host and MCP transport
  + [outside] is relationship graph automatic relevance truth verification mutation authorization faculty execution effects authentication and publication
